                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If this unit is **^^Gitmob^^**, roll D3+3 instead. This unit can move a distance in inches up to the roll. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
